---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="How The Japan Desk handles data." breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy', url: '/privacy/' }]}>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10">
    <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif prose-a:text-accent-600">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how The Japan Desk ("we", "us") handles information when you visit thejapandesk.net.</p>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate, anonymized traffic. We do not use this to identify you personally.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We and third parties (analytics, affiliate networks) may set cookies. Affiliate cookies record that you arrived via our link so a commission can be attributed. You can control cookies via the consent banner and your browser settings.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact:</strong> If you email us, we receive the information you send.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>UK/EU visitors</h2>
      <p>For visitors in the UK, the EEA and Switzerland, we do not load analytics or affiliate scripts until you accept them — we rely on your consent for non-essential cookies. You may decline without losing access to content, and you have rights to access, correct, or delete your personal data — contact us to exercise them.</p>
      <h2>Visitors elsewhere</h2>
      <p>Outside those regions, non-essential cookies load by default and you can opt out at any time using Decline on the consent banner. Your choice is stored in your browser and applies to subsequent visits.</p>
      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>Analytics and affiliate networks process data under their own policies (e.g., Google, Amazon, ShareASale, Awin, CJ, Impact, Travelpayouts, GetYourGuide, 12Go). We do not sell your personal information.</p>
      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is not directed to children under 16.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:hello@thejapandesk.net">hello@thejapandesk.net</a>, or via our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
